// programs tier — whole-program pin, dissolved from
// corpus/ at the freeze (T6.4).
// out: 42
// out: 10
// out: 32
// out: e0-b
// out: e16-b
// out: e32-b
// n18 — the declaration tables grow: 33 structs, 17 traits,
// 33 enums ride parse()'s tables past the old fixed caps
// (32/16/32; the fn table already grew). The first and last
// entries of each table are constructed, matched, and called.

